    "main_image_carousel_KA8Ddg": {
      "type": "main-image-carousel",
      "blocks": {
        "card_9arCMX": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_01.webp",
            "modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/600_660-0.webp",
            "mobile_modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/M_1.webp",
            "title": "<p>Optimize Sleep, Elevate Energy</p>",
            "eye_brow_label": "",
            "eye_brow_value": "",
            "des1": "<p>FANY tracks all four sleep stages with lab-level accuracy and provides personalized tips to help you sleep better, recover fully, and perform at your best.</p>",
            "eyebrow": "<p>Member Spotlight</p>",
            "comment": "<p>“I really love the sleep tracking feature! It helps me see how much deep sleep or light sleep I get. I absolutely love it. Overall, everything is perfect and so light to wear! ”<br/></p>",
            "author": "<p>beebee.family3</p>",
            "des2": ""
          }
        },
        "card_TbjQwK": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_02.webp",
            "modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/600_660-1.webp",
            "mobile_modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/M_2.webp",
            "title": "<p>Know Your Cycle, Master Your Health</p>",
            "eye_brow_label": "",
            "eye_brow_value": "",
            "des1": "<p>FANY helps you understand your true cycle, ovulation and emotions, predict your periods, and support your scheduling, family planning, health protection and cycle-friendly relaxation.</p>",
            "eyebrow": "<p>Member Spotlight</p>",
            "comment": "<p>\"During my luteal phase, I can feel super emotional, not want to talk to anyone, and even end up eating everything in the fridge. My luteal phase used to be my biggest 'opp,' but the FANY watch has been a total lifesaver. It tracks my cycle, lets me log symptoms, and helps me see patterns over time. It also tracks my stress levels and reminds me to breathe or drink water, which really helps me work with my body instead of against it.\"</p>",
            "author": "<p>Marjonai Smith</p>",
            "des2": ""
          }
        },
        "card_HGVkRH": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_03.webp",
            "modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/600_660-2.webp",
            "mobile_modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/M_3.webp",
            "title": "<p>Monitor Emotion & Stress, Practice Self-Care</p>",
            "eye_brow_label": "",
            "eye_brow_value": "",
            "des1": "<p>FANY monitors your emotion and stress in real time, and guides you through 1-minute breathing exercises to quickly relax, relieve pressure, and rebalance your mood.</p>",
            "eyebrow": "<p>Member Spotlight</p>",
            "comment": "<p>“This watch can track your stress and emotions very accurately. Most of the time I feel happy and calm, but one day I received some unexpected news. When I checked my watch, it showed that I was feeling upset.<br/>There’s a built-in feature that guides you through breathing exercises to help you calm down. I think everyone can benefit from this, because sometimes we don’t even realize we need to pause, take a moment, and breathe deeply to relax our body and mind.<br/>In that moment, I was really grateful for this watch. It helped me stop, take a breath, and calm myself down. This has been one of the most helpful features for me.”</p>",
            "author": "<p>Avavlogs</p>",
            "des2": ""
          }
        },
        "card_yxnw8G": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_04.webp",
            "modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/600_660-3.webp",
            "mobile_modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/M_4.webp",
            "title": "<p>Monitor Heart Rate 24/7， Always Protected</p>",
            "eye_brow_label": "",
            "eye_brow_value": "",
            "des1": "<p>FANY continuously monitors your heart rate, alerts you to unusual trends, and helps you catch potential risks early for safer, smarter heart care.</p>",
            "eyebrow": "<p>Member Spotlight</p>",
            "comment": "<p>\"I'd feel stressed or exhausted without really knowing why, and some days it feels like my heart's going to beat out of my chest. The FANY Luna smartwatch tracks my heart rate throughout the day, and I started noticing patterns—like when stress makes it spike or when lack of sleep affects it. It's been such a simple way to understand my body and take better care of myself.\"</p>",
            "author": "<p>Jessica Kennedy</p>",
            "des2": ""
          }
        },
        "card_J6QcGz": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_05.webp",
            "modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/600_660-4.webp",
            "mobile_modal_image": "shopify://shop_images/M_5.webp",
            "title": "<p>Track 110+ Sports, Train Like a Pro Coach</p>",
            "eye_brow_label": "",
            "eye_brow_value": "",
            "des1": "<p>FANY tracks steps & 110+ sports, yoga, running, strength training and more. Real-time heart rate, calorie stats and smart workout guidance keep you safe, effective and motivated. Move smarter, live stronger.</p>",
            "eyebrow": "<p>Member Spotlight</p>",
            "comment": "<p>“I like the prompts it sends about my current (or missing steps) I love seeing the reports on things like heartbeat throughout the day, steps etc. it does remind me to move more or be mindful! ”</p>",
            "author": "<p>PrintStick</p>",
            "des2": ""
          }
        }
      },
